## Repository rules

- Follow `AGENTS.md` and the relevant documents in `docs/`.
- Preserve the established HRM green, white, soft-gray, and slate design system.
- Inspect existing feature components, hooks, schemas, and services before adding replacements.
- Keep business state and mock data typed and feature-local; do not invent backend calls.
- Preserve validation, authorization, keyboard access, and responsive behavior.
- Run lint, typecheck, tests, Storybook build, and production build after implementation.
- Do not commit secrets or store sensitive authentication data in local storage.
